{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1668,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"Give thanks to the LORD! Call on his name! Make his doings known among the peoples.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5729},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1669,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"Sing to him, sing praises to him! Tell of all his marvelous works.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5732},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1670,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"Glory in his holy name. Let the heart of those who seek the LORD rejoice.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5735},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1671,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"Seek the LORD and his strength. Seek his face forever more.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5738},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1672,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"Remember his marvelous works that he has done: his wonders, and the judgments of his mouth,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5741},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1673,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"you offspring of Abraham, his servant, you children of Jacob, his chosen ones.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5744},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1674,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"He is the LORD, our God. His judgments are in all the earth.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5747},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1675,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"He has remembered his covenant forever, the word which he commanded to a thousand generations,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5750},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1676,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"the covenant which he made with Abraham, his oath to Isaac,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5753},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1677,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"and confirmed it to Jacob for a statute; to Israel for an everlasting covenant,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5756},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1678,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"saying, “To you I will give the land of Canaan, the lot of your inheritance,”","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5759},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1679,"verse_start":12,"verse_end":12,"verse_label":"12","text":"when they were but a few men in number, yes, very few, and foreigners in it.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5762},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1680,"verse_start":13,"verse_end":13,"verse_label":"13","text":"They went about from nation to nation, from one kingdom to another people.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5765},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1681,"verse_start":14,"verse_end":14,"verse_label":"14","text":"He allowed no one to do them wrong. Yes, he reproved kings for their sakes,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5768},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1682,"verse_start":15,"verse_end":15,"verse_label":"15","text":"“Don’t touch my anointed ones! Do my prophets no harm!”","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5771},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1683,"verse_start":16,"verse_end":16,"verse_label":"16","text":"He called for a famine on the land. He destroyed the food supplies.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5774},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1684,"verse_start":17,"verse_end":17,"verse_label":"17","text":"He sent a man before them. Joseph was sold for a slave.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5777},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1685,"verse_start":18,"verse_end":18,"verse_label":"18","text":"They bruised his feet with shackles. His neck was locked in irons,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5780},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1686,"verse_start":19,"verse_end":19,"verse_label":"19","text":"until the time that his word happened, and the LORD’s word proved him true.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5783},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1687,"verse_start":20,"verse_end":20,"verse_label":"20","text":"The king sent and freed him, even the ruler of peoples, and let him go free.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5786},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1688,"verse_start":21,"verse_end":21,"verse_label":"21","text":"He made him lord of his house, and ruler of all of his possessions,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5789},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1689,"verse_start":22,"verse_end":22,"verse_label":"22","text":"to discipline his princes at his pleasure, and to teach his elders wisdom.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5792},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1690,"verse_start":23,"verse_end":23,"verse_label":"23","text":"Israel also came into Egypt. Jacob lived in the land of Ham.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5795},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1691,"verse_start":24,"verse_end":24,"verse_label":"24","text":"He increased his people greatly, and made them stronger than their adversaries.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5798},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1692,"verse_start":25,"verse_end":25,"verse_label":"25","text":"He turned their heart to hate his people, to conspire against his servants.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5801},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1693,"verse_start":26,"verse_end":26,"verse_label":"26","text":"He sent Moses, his servant, and Aaron, whom he had chosen.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5804},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1694,"verse_start":27,"verse_end":27,"verse_label":"27","text":"They performed miracles among them, and wonders in the land of Ham.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5807},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1695,"verse_start":28,"verse_end":28,"verse_label":"28","text":"He sent darkness, and made it dark. They didn’t rebel against his words.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5810},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1696,"verse_start":29,"verse_end":29,"verse_label":"29","text":"He turned their waters into blood, and killed their fish.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5813},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1697,"verse_start":30,"verse_end":30,"verse_label":"30","text":"Their land swarmed with frogs, even in the rooms of their kings.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5816},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1698,"verse_start":31,"verse_end":31,"verse_label":"31","text":"He spoke, and swarms of flies came, and lice in all their borders.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5819},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1699,"verse_start":32,"verse_end":32,"verse_label":"32","text":"He gave them hail for rain, with lightning in their land.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5822},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1700,"verse_start":33,"verse_end":33,"verse_label":"33","text":"He struck their vines and also their fig trees, and shattered the trees of their country.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5825},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1701,"verse_start":34,"verse_end":34,"verse_label":"34","text":"He spoke, and the locusts came with the grasshoppers, without number.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5828},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1702,"verse_start":35,"verse_end":35,"verse_label":"35","text":"They ate up every plant in their land, and ate up the fruit of their ground.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5831},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1703,"verse_start":36,"verse_end":36,"verse_label":"36","text":"He struck also all the firstborn in their land, the first fruits of all their manhood.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5834},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1704,"verse_start":37,"verse_end":37,"verse_label":"37","text":"He brought them out with silver and gold. There was not one feeble person among his tribes.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5837},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1705,"verse_start":38,"verse_end":38,"verse_label":"38","text":"Egypt was glad when they departed, for the fear of them had fallen on them.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5840},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1706,"verse_start":39,"verse_end":39,"verse_label":"39","text":"He spread a cloud for a covering, fire to give light in the night.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5843},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1707,"verse_start":40,"verse_end":40,"verse_label":"40","text":"They asked, and he brought quails, and satisfied them with the bread of the sky.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5846},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1708,"verse_start":41,"verse_end":41,"verse_label":"41","text":"He opened the rock, and waters gushed out. They ran as a river in the dry places.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5849},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1709,"verse_start":42,"verse_end":42,"verse_label":"42","text":"For he remembered his holy word, and Abraham, his servant.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5852},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1710,"verse_start":43,"verse_end":43,"verse_label":"43","text":"He brought his people out with joy, his chosen with singing.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5855},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1711,"verse_start":44,"verse_end":44,"verse_label":"44","text":"He gave them the lands of the nations. They took the labor of the peoples in possession,","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5858},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":105,"verse_ordinal":1712,"verse_start":45,"verse_end":45,"verse_label":"45","text":"that they might keep his statutes, and observe his laws. Praise the LORD!","is_omitted":0,"source_line":5861}]}